"class=\"text-o-color-5\"> </font><font class=\"text-800\">定番の三脚型A"
"フレーム・スタジオイーゼル</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_30
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>Ultra-Soft Texture:</strong> </"
"font>S<font class=\"text-800\">pun from premium fibers to ensure a smooth, "
"snag-free experience that is gentle on your hands and luxurious to the touch."
"</font>"
