"offer a comfortable grip and a professional look.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">人間工学に基づいたデザイン:</font></"
"strong> <font class=\"text-800\">快適な握り心地とプロ仕様の洗練された外観を兼"
"ね備えた、エレガントなマットブラックのハンドルを採用しています。</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_30
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">Excellent Stitch Definition:</font></"
"strong> <font class=\"text-800\">The high-twist construction ensures your "
"patterns and textures stand out with professional clarity.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">くっきりと映える美しい編み目:</font></"
"strong> <font class=\"text-800\">しっかりと撚りをかけた強撚糸を使用しているた"
"め、模様編みや立体的なテクスチャーが潰れず、プロが編んだような洗練された仕上"
"がりになります。</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_28
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">Great for all skill levels</font></"
"strong> – Perfect for beginners, hobby artists, students, and creative "
"enthusiasts."
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">初心者から上級者まで</font></strong> "
"– 初めての方から趣味で楽しむ方、学生、ハンドメイド好きの方まで、どなたでも手"
"軽にお楽しみいただけます。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_27
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">Hardware:</font></strong> <font "
"class=\"text-800\">Corrosion-resistant polished brass knobs and fittings for "
"smooth height and tilt adjustments.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">金具・パーツ:</font></strong> <font "
"class=\"text-800\">耐食性に優れた研磨仕上げの真鍮製ノブと金具を採用。高さや角"
"度の調整がスムーズに行えます。</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_32
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">High-Performance Bristles:</font></"
"strong> <font class=\"text-800\">Crafted with high-quality synthetic fibers "
"that maintain their shape and provide smooth, consistent paint flow.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">高性能な筆毛:</font></strong> <font "
"class=\"text-800\">形状をしっかり維持し、ムラのないスムーズな絵の具の含みと伸"
"びを実現する、高品質な合成繊維を採用しています。</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_27
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">Material:</font></strong> <font "
"class=\"text-800\">Premium, sustainably sourced solid Beechwood with a "
"natural light-oil finish.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">素材:</font></strong> <font "
"class=\"text-800\">サステナブルな方法で調達された上質なブナ無垢材を使用し、"
"ナチュラルなライトオイル仕上げを施しています。</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_27
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">Maximum Canvas Height:</font></"
"strong> <font class=\"text-800\">Accommodates canvases up to <strong>120 cm "
"(47 inches)</strong> tall.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">対応最大キャンバス高:</font></strong> "
"<font class=\"text-800\">高さ最大 <strong>120 cm (47 インチ)</strong> までの"
"キャンバスに対応しています。</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_29
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">Perfect Weight for Folding:</font></"
"strong> <font class=\"text-800\">Specially selected paper thickness that "
"holds its shape without tearing, making it ideal for beginners and advanced "
"crafters alike.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">折るのに最適な絶妙な厚み:</font></"
"strong> <font class=\"text-800\">破れにくく折り目がキレイに残るこだわりの紙厚"
"を厳選。初心者から上級者まで、ストレスなく作品づくりを楽しめます。</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_32
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">Premium Presentation:</font></"
"strong> <font class=\"text-800\">Housed in a minimalist, white designer box "
"with a large transparent window, making it an ideal gift for professionals "
"and hobbyists alike.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">上質なパッケージデザイン:</font></"
"strong> <font class=\"text-800\">大きな透明窓が付いたミニマルなホワイトの"
"デザインボックスに収納されており、プロのアーティストへの贈り物や趣味を楽しむ"
"方へのギフトにも最適です。</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_30
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">Signature Color Palette:</font></"
"strong> <font class=\"text-800\">A harmonious blend of rich earth tones and "
"vibrant accents that complement any crochet or knitting project.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">特選カラーパレット:</font></strong> "
"<font class=\"text-800\">落ち着いたアースカラーと鮮やかなアクセントカラーが見"
"事に調和。かぎ針編みから棒針編みまで、どんな編み物作品もワンランク上の仕上が"
"りに引き立てます。</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_29
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">Stunning Geometric Patterns:</font></"
"strong> <font class=\"text-800\">From bold triangles and chevrons to modern "
"dots and stripes, each sheet is printed with vibrant, high-contrast colors "
"(teal, pink, sunny yellow, and more).</font>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-3\">モダンで映える幾何学模様:</font></"
"strong> <font class=\"text-800\">トライアングルやシェブロン、ドットや"
"ストライプなど、鮮やかでメリハリのあるカラー(ティール、ピンク、サニーイエロー"
"など)で美しくプリントされています。</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_30
msgid "<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-5\">Key Features:</font></strong>"
msgstr "<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-5\">主な特徴：</font></strong>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_29
msgid "<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-5\">What’s Inside:</font></strong>"
msgstr "<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-5\">内容：</font></strong>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_1
msgid ""
"<strong>Acrylics:</strong> Learn to play with texture, layering, and thick "
"applications to bring depth to your canvas."
msgstr ""
"<strong>アクリル画:</strong>重ね塗りや厚塗り、さまざまな質感表現を楽しみなが"
"ら、キャンバスの上に豊かな奥行きを表現する方法を学びます。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Activities</strong><span class=\"h1-fs\"> </span>"
msgstr "<strong>活動</strong><span class=\"h1-fs\"> </span>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_1
msgid ""
"<strong>Aquarelle (Watercolor):</strong> Master transparency, color "
"blending, and water control to create light and poetic atmospheres."
msgstr ""
"<strong>水彩画(アクアレル):</strong> 透明感のある発色、美しい色の混ざり合い、"
"そして水のコントロールを身につけ、光と情景が織りなす詩的な雰囲気を作り出しま"
"しょう。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<strong>Atmosphere:</strong> A calm, zen-like environment where you can work "
"at your own pace."
msgstr ""
"<strong>雰囲気:</strong>自分のペースで作業に没頭できる、落ち着いた静かな環境"
"です。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<strong>Booking:</strong> Limited spots available to ensure personalized "
"attention for every student"
msgstr ""
"<strong>お申し込み</strong>：お一人おひとりにきめ細やかな指導をお届けするため"
"、人数に限りがあります"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_1
msgid ""
"<strong>Booking:</strong> Limited spots available to ensure quality guidance."
msgstr ""
"<strong>お申し込み：</strong> 質の高い指導を確保するため、定員に限りがありま"
"す。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<strong>Creative Variations:</strong> Once you've mastered the basics, learn "
"how to use different paper textures and patterns to give your creations a "
"unique touch."
msgstr ""
"<strong>クリエイティブなアレンジ：</strong> 基本をマスターしたら、さまざまな"
"紙の質感や模様を活用して、作品に独自のタッチを加える方法を学びましょう。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Do you want to go further?</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>さらに進みますか?</strong>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_1
msgid ""
"<strong>Gouache:</strong> Discover the joy of this matte, opaque paint, "
"perfect for vibrant flat colors and precise details."
msgstr ""
"<strong>グアッシュ：</strong> 鮮やかな単色や精密なディテール表現に最適な、"
"マットで不透明な絵の具の魅力をぜひ体験してください。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_1
msgid "<strong>Level:</strong> All levels welcome."
msgstr "<strong>レベル：</strong>どなたでもご参加いただけます。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<strong>Level:</strong> Beginners and enthusiasts of all ages (minimum 8+ "
"recommended)."
msgstr "<strong>レベル：</strong> 初心者から大人までどなたでも(推奨：8歳以上)。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<strong>Level:</strong> Perfect for absolute beginners (adults and teens "
"welcome)."
msgstr "<strong>レベル：</strong> 未経験者大歓迎(中高生・大人の方どなたでも)"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_2
msgid "<strong>Location:</strong> Arts-craft store, Ramillies."
msgstr "<strong>開催場所:</strong> Arts-craft store(Ramillies)"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_1
msgid "<strong>Location:</strong> Arts-craft, Ramillies."
msgstr "<strong>ロケーション:</strong> アート・クラフト、Ramillies。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_3
msgid "<strong>Location:</strong> indu-arts-craft-store, Ramillies."
msgstr "<strong>開催場所:</strong> indu-arts-craft-store(Ramillies)"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<strong>Pattern Reading:</strong> Learn how to decipher simple patterns so "
"you can continue your journey at home."
msgstr ""
"<strong>パターンの読み方: </strong>シンプルな図案の読み方を習得して、ご自宅で"
"も続きを楽しめるようサポートします。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_3
msgid "<strong>Results from one of our previous workshop:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>実績・受講者の作品紹介:</strong>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_1
msgid ""
"<strong>See what our students created following this workshop:</strong>\n"
"                    <br>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>受講生の作品紹介:</strong>\n"
"                    <br>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<strong>Symmetry and Precision:</strong> Understand how geometric accuracy "
"leads to beautiful results"
msgstr ""
"<strong>シンメトリーと精密度:</strong>正確な形づくりが美しい完成度につながる"
"理由を学びます"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<strong>The Basics of Folding:</strong> Learn the foundational folds—"
"mountain folds, valley folds, and reverse folds—that form the basis of all "
"origami."
msgstr ""
"<strong>折り方の基本: </strong>すべての折り紙の基礎となる、山折り・谷折り・中"
"割り折り（かぶせ折り）などの基本技術を学びます。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<strong>The Core Stitches:</strong> Master the essentials, including the "
"chain stitch, single crochet, and double crochet."
msgstr ""
"<strong>基本の編み方: </strong>くさり編み、細編み、長編みなど、かぎ針編みの必"
"須テクニックをマスターします。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<strong>The Day's Project:</strong> You’ll put your new skills to work "
"immediately by starting a stylish project (such as a modern coaster or a "
"cozy winter headband)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>本日のプロジェクト：</strong> スタイリッシュなプロジェクト(モダンな"
"コースターや、温かみのある冬のヘッドバンドなど)に取り組み、学んだスキルをすぐ"
"に実践します。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<strong>The Fundamentals:</strong> Getting to know your tools—understanding "
"different yarn weights and hook sizes."
msgstr ""
"<strong>基本：</strong> 道具を知る――さまざまな糸の太さとフックのサイズを理解"
"しましょう。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<strong>Traditional Models:</strong> We will guide you through creating "
"classic designs such as the iconic paper crane, elegant butterflies, and "
"seasonal flowers."
msgstr ""
"<strong>伝統的なモデル：</strong> 象徴的な折り鶴、優雅な蝶、季節の花など、"
"クラシックなデザインの作り方を丁寧にガイドします。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:art_craft.product_template_28
msgid "<strong>— Elena M., Landscape Artist, Verified buyer</strong><br>"
msgstr "<strong>— Elena M. (ランドスケープアーティスト、認定済購入者) </strong><br>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.welcome_article_body
