msgstr "マップを埋め込むにはアドレスを特定する必要があります"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_2
msgid "An ergonomic crochet hook perfectly suited for beginners."
msgstr "初心者にもぴったりの、人間工学に基づいたかぎ針。"

#. module: art_craft
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_art_craft
msgid "Arts & Crafts Store"
msgstr "アート・クラフト用品店"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:art_craft.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"As creative hobbies grew in popularity, so did the demand for dedicated art "
"and craft materials. In the <strong>1970s</strong>, the shop gradually began "
"focusing more strongly on <strong>art and craft supplies</strong>, expanding "
"its range to meet the needs of artists, makers, and hobby enthusiasts."
